# Vue components

- Export as `X<Name>` from `index.ts` (e.g. `XButton`)
- SFC `name` matches: `XButton` in plain `<script lang="ts">`
- Use `ExtractPublicPropTypes` for public prop types
- Prefer existing composables: `useTheme`, `useColors`, `useCommon` — read a sibling component before adding new patterns
- Sub-components live in the same folder with their own theme files
- Register new components in `src/components/index.ts` and both `src/themes/base/components.ts` and `src/themes/carbon/components.ts`

Reference implementation: `packages/ui/src/components/button/`
